					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							the guild roster has just been edited. If your char are not in BBB or JpG they have been removed from the guild roster. If you are not in BBB or JpG and wish to add yourself or re-add yourself to the sight please email me at Torlace@blackburrowbrawlers.com and i will make sure your added.<br />
<br />
The char that have not been added to this sight might find themselves guildless in the next few weeks. There will be many changes in BBB over the next few weeks. I need everyone to be apart of this site, so you all know about events and raids.<br />
<br />
I do not wish to remove anyone from BBB, expessialy those who are respected members of BBB. If you know anyone that is in JpG or BBB that is not on this site, please inform them that they must add themselves. <br />
<br />
these rules and upcoming rules will be mandatory for BBB, some of these rules may not aply to JpG. JpG has their own set of rules for certian situations.<br />
<br />
Rules will be posted in the next few days.
